      "review_summary": "This PR bounds gateway `BOOT.md` loading to 16 MiB with `readRegularFile`, preserves readable symlink behavior, and adds focused gateway boot tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +35, Tests +34. Total +69 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current main clearly reads `BOOT.md` through unbounded `fs.readFile`, so creating an oversized workspace `BOOT.md` and running the boot-md startup path would exercise the reported behavior; I did not execute current main locally.",
